Z||000002||Bigred||09-22-2001||09:32 PM||||True, True, They are vent scoops. They curl up over the roof.  The outside edge follows the rear windowsabd the inside edge curves inward. They have a certain eligant look to them even scratched with small rust spots. I have had an 88 coupe for several years and have recently aquired an 87 gt that will get every trunk, side, and hood scoop that will serve a function ie cold air intake, oil cooler, raditor air flow, look good.  I have not seen them offered.  What price for looks good? ||||reg||1
